hen the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializer succeeds.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example converts the position of the Unicode scalar ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"e\""},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"into its corresponding position in the string. The character at that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position is the composed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"é\""},{"type":"text","text":" character."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let cafe = \"Cafe\\u{0301}\"","print(cafe)","\/\/ Prints \"Café\"","","let scalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.firstIndex(of: \"e\")!","let stringIndex = String.Index(scalarsIndex, within: cafe)!","","print(cafe[...stringIndex])","\/\/ Prints \"Café\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the index passed as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sourcePosition"},{"type":"text","text":" doesn’t have an exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding position in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":", the result of the initializer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":". For example, an attempt to convert the position of the combining"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"acute accent ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\\u{0301}\""},{"type":"text","text":") fails. Combining Unicode scalars do not have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their own position in a string."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let nextScalarsIndex = cafe.unicodeScalars.index(after: scalarsIndex)","let nextStringIndex = String.Index(nextScalarsIndex, within: cafe)","","print(nextStringIndex)","\/\/ Prints \"nil\""],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/String/Index/init(_:within:)-2u3iq":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identi